            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "You are the Onboarding Agent for HR New Hire Welcome Packet. You run once per new-hire row, immediately after the trigger. You have three tools: Get items, Send email, and Update item. Send every email at Normal importance. Do not mark anything Low or High priority.\n\nHIRE ROW FOR THIS RUN\nid: {triggerOutputs()?['body/ID']}\nPreferred name: {triggerOutputs()?['body/Title']}\nWork email: {triggerOutpu"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "variable-faf9b4df-2036-499f-959a-6fb24d953d1b",
            "name": "Configuration",
            "type": "variable",
            "position": {
              "x": 608.1626385018347,
              "y": 224.73718742671687
            },
            "details": {}
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-f530af65-6ff7-46fe-981c-c401d3e5ab44",
            "name": "Note",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 263.1945194005484,
              "y": 362.9703270341611
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Fires when a row is added to New Hires. \n\nSite/list are set directly here, reselect them in this trigger to point at your own list. \n\nAfter doing so, every \"field_N\" dynamic-content token in Onboarding Agent's prompt will break (SharePoint assigns these per-list) — reopen the agent and re-insert each one from the dynamic content picker against your own list's columns.\n",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-0aa7edc5-01f8-4cc3-83ee-80af0d1d4177",
            "name": "Note 2",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 611.0574489954424,
              "y": 357.3381847480087
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Configuration variables: \n\n• HRNotifyEmail — where HR gets alerted (missing data / no audience match) \n\n• WelcomeLinksSite — full SharePoint site URL (e.g. https://yourtenant.sharepoint.com/teams/YourSiteName).\nWelcomeLinksSite locates the SharePoint site to find the list on — it's not a source of links itself; every link, URL, and description the agent sends always comes from rows inside the Welc",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-a53507e7-a46f-4b75-9ec6-e6e13b2aeec4",
            "name": "Note 3",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1085.9941381479703,
              "y": 329.3306401842956
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Onboarding Agent — runs once per new-hire row, right after the trigger. Stops if Packet sent is already set. Alerts HR and stops if any required field was missing. Otherwise: calls Get items once on Welcome Links, decides which audience the job title matches (or that none do) and which rows belong in the email — the agent does this selection itself, not a SharePoint filter — emails the hire (Cc ma",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-aa583182-e79a-4075-8057-c3fe9a45ad41",
            "name": "Note 5",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 268.42179073815925,
              "y": -88.80812389322855
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Expected columns\n\nNew Hires (first list): Preferred name, Work email, Job title, Start date, Manager email, Packet sent. \n\nWelcome Links (second list): Audience (text - \"Everyone\" or a role word), Link name, URL (Hyperlink), Description (optional).\n",
              "color": "green"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-5f327463-8646-4cfb-a13e-b131d3053b95",
            "name": "Note 7",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1083.33573841494,
              "y": -154.6895556128317
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Reconnect required: Delete and re-add this node's tool connections -\n1. Sharepoint - get items\n2. Sharepoint - update item\n3. Office 365 Outlook - send an email\n\nConnections don't automatically renew for a new user who acquires this workflow.",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "agent-fb7e675d-b47e-43f9-a603-1289da05d738",
            "name": "Team Intro Agent",
            "type": "agent",
            "position": {
              "x": 1616.970448875372,
              "y": 218.41631167370176
            },
            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "```\nYou are the Team Intro Agent for HR New Hire Welcome Packet. You run once per new-hire row, in parallel with the Onboarding Agent. You have two tools: Get manager and Get direct reports, both read-only, plus web search. You never send email, never update any row, and never take any action beyond producing the result described below.\n\nHIRE ROW FOR THIS RUN\nPreferred name: {triggerOutputs()?['bo"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-952261e6-c2d2-4980-8578-d2b5d389f4ba",
            "name": "Note 4",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1615.668036802225,
              "y": 383.40930102872517
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Team Intro Agent — runs in parallel with Onboarding Agent off the same trigger, not blocking or blocked by it. Builds the new hire's team roster via Get manager + Get direct reports (Office 365 Users, read-only), drops blank-title/shadow accounts and the new hire's own self-match, caps at 10 people. For the manager plus each person, searches the web for a public LinkedIn match and writes a short f",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-80de7f4d-2ba5-4fd7-9aad-4b16c0ee6350",
            "name": "Note 6",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 1604.3621494932686,
              "y": -15.596911830783057
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "Reconnect required: Delete and re-add this node's tool connections - \n\n1. Office 365 Users - get manager \n\n2. Office 365 Users - get direct reports. Connections don't automatically renew for a new user who acquires this workflow.\n",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
