            "details": {
              "markdown": "If AutoSendTeamIntro is Yes → Send an email (V2) sends directly to the new hire, CC HR. Else → Draft an email message creates the same email as a draft in HR's mailbox for manual review. Both branches use the same To/Subject/Body/CC from Team Intro Agent's output.",
              "color": "yellow"
